# slimevr-imu-log v1
# sensor LSM6DSV
# acc_ts 0.008319467
# gyr_ts 0.0041597337
# acc_scale 0.0011964112
# gyr_scale 6.1086525E-4
# note raw uncalibrated counts; apply *_scale to convert
#
# Test fixture, not a corpus recording. Right leg, mid-shin, same tracker and
# mounting as the stamping fixture. Normal overground walking at a comfortable
# pace, in a circle -- the case issue #41 actually turns on, since a normal heel
# strike is far softer than a stamp and is buried in the leg's own swing.
#
# Walking a circle rather than in place means the capture carries a continuous
# yaw rotation on top of the gait. That is closer to real use than stepping on
# the spot, and it is worth knowing before drawing any conclusion from this file
# about how quiet a leg gets between steps.
